# flutter_nav_kit

- Public API is `lib/flutter_nav_kit.dart` only.
- Path-depend on sibling `lemsa_core_kit` and `flutter_page_kit`.
- Implement `PageNavigator`; do not reinvent PageData or Notices.
- Guards take an app-owned `isSignedIn` callback — never hardcode session providers.
- Sign-out performs **no** navigation.
- Controllers never call raw `Navigator`.
- Use `fvm flutter` (pin 3.35.7). Never upgrade the shared SDK.
- Do not start other kits unless asked.
